  "note": "golive-ab: docs/124 §17 go-live timing A/B in one load, NOT RUN. Gated on golive-act passing. --ab autlive flips the ts3fixes switch per slice: off = Mode 3 with no request (the game's search; guard thunks and the B14 pass-through in both arms), on = consume. Timing ini: Audit 0, VerifyEvery 0, DumpOnMismatch 0, Satb=2, Sample 1, noSamplers. Smoke first (queue.ts runs it): arms split, switch read back, al consumed grows only in on slices. Natural play on BP and IP (2-min slices, both orders) and the crowd-in-view repro (5-min slices, both orders; memory offload-goal: offload is judged on crowded visible scenes). Judge (docs/124 §14.4 S4, offload rule): sim busy ms/s off - on and the autonomy-search owner (node tools/harness/sim-budget-report.ts per arm), pooled over both orders; hitches with node tools/harness/hitch-ab.ts golive-ab (p99, p99.9, max, counts >= 300 / 1000 ms); it/s not down > 2% in the pooled pair mean. Clean machine (load line), no other build or agent during the job. No net gain outside the noise band in 2 build rounds = ship off (PLAN rule).",
